{
  "id": "about-the-author",
  "kind": "epilogue",
  "sourceKind": "about-author",
  "label": "About the Author",
  "title": "ABOUT THE AUTHOR-",
  "shortTitle": "ABOUT THE AUTHOR-",
  "sourceRange": [
    2604,
    2632
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 2604
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lalit R Mishra is not trying to be understood."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2605
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And maybe that’s exactly why people end up trying to understand him."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2606
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "He doesn’t speak like someone who is “explaining life.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2607
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "He speaks like someone who is still watching it happen in real time."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2608
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is something unusual about his writing "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2609
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it doesn’t feel like information."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2610
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It feels like someone is sitting in your head and pointing out thoughts you usually ignore."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2611
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "He is not a philosopher."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2612
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not a guru."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2613
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not a motivational voice."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2614
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Just someone who noticed a strange pattern:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2615
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": " people don’t suffer because life is complicated…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2616
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "they suffer because their mind keeps adding meaning to everything."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2617
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And the more you read him…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2618
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the more uncomfortable it becomes to pretend you don’t relate."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2619
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "His writing style is simple, but not soft."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2620
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Direct, but not loud."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2621
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Deep, but not trying to impress."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2622
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It doesn’t tell you what to think."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2623
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It makes you notice what you are already thinking."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2624
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And somewhere in between reading him…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2625
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you don’t feel like you are reading a book anymore."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2626
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You feel like you are being observed by your own thoughts."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2627
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "He is not offering answers."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2628
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "He is exposing the habit of chasing them."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2629
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And if you ever feel like talking to him after reading this…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2630
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that is not curiosity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2631
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That is recognition."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2632
    }
  ],
  "suppressHeaderNumber": true,
  "index": 24,
  "file": "chapters/24-about-the-author.json"
}
